      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787218550705,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Computes pairwise similarity between Evidence & Controls:\n  Similarity = (E · C) / ( ||E|| * ||C|| )\n• Compares semantic intent beyond simple keyword matches\n  (e.g. 'disk space 68%' matches 'storage capacity thresholds')\n• Produces ranked control affinity list per evidence item",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Computes pairwise similarity between Evidence & Controls:\n  Similarity = (E · C) / ( ||E|| * ||C|| )\n• Compares semantic intent beyond simple keyword matches\n  (e.g. 'disk space 68%' matches 'storage capacity thresholds')\n• Produces ranked control affinity list per evidence item",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "ae"
