      "updated": 1787218550705,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Boolean Match:\n  EQUALS, NOT_EQUALS\n  (True/False, 1/0, on/off)\n• Numeric Comparison:\n  <, <=, >, >=, ==, !=\n  (68% < 80% ➜ PASS)\n  (35d >= 30d ➜ PASS)\n• String Enums & IN\n• Instant 100% confidence\n• Zero LLM API latency",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Boolean Match:\n  EQUALS, NOT_EQUALS\n  (True/False, 1/0, on/off)\n• Numeric Comparison:\n  <, <=, >, >=, ==, !=\n  (68% < 80% ➜ PASS)\n  (35d >= 30d ➜ PASS)\n• String Enums & IN\n• Instant 100% confidence\n• Zero LLM API latency",
